1. **\`analytic_covariance\` test.** \`analytic_covariance_matches_analytic_signal\` (\`src/music.rs\`) compares it with \`(1/N) Z Zᴴ\` from \`analytic_signal\` for 4 channels of pseudo-random data and every N from 1 to 40, odd and even, with a relative limit of 1e-12. As a check, doubling the Nyquist weight makes it fail at N = 2.
